<!-- /wp:wdl/custom-title-2 -->

<!-- wp:wdl/paid-block-content-7 {"imageBorderRadius":0,"titleBorderRadius":0} -->
<div class="wp-block-wdl-paid-block-content-7 paid-block-content-7"><ul class="paid-block-content-7__inner"><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-zairyu/" class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_list_1/card_1_zairyu.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">在留資格・ビザ</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">外国人の方の在留資格の認定・変更・更新から、永住や帰化のご相談まで。会社で外国人材を雇うときの手続きもお任せください。</p></a></li><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-sanpai/" class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_list_1/card_2_sanpai.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">産業廃棄物収集運搬業許可</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">産業廃棄物を運ぶために必要な許可の新規取得、5年ごとの更新、積替保管の追加まで対応いたします。</p></a></li><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-kensetsu/" class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_list_1/card_3_kensetsu.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">建設業許可</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">知事許可・大臣許可の新規取得のほか、毎年の決算変更届、業種の追加、経営事項審査までまとめてお引き受けします。</p></a></li></ul></div>
<!-- /wp:wdl/paid-block-content-7 -->

<!-- wp:wdl/paid-block-content-7 {"imageBorderRadius":0,"titleBorderRadius":0} -->
<div class="wp-block-wdl-paid-block-content-7 paid-block-content-7"><ul class="paid-block-content-7__inner"><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-souzoku/" class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_list_1/card_4_souzoku.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">相続・遺言</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">戸籍の収集から相続関係説明図、遺産分割協議書の作成まで。公正証書遺言の原案づくりもご相談ください。</p></a></li><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-setsuritsu/" class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_list_1/card_5_setsuritsu.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">会社設立</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">株式会社・合同会社の定款作成から、設立後に必要な各種届出まで。事業の内容に合った会社の形からご提案します。</p></a></li><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-eigyo/" class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_list_1/card_6_eigyo.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">営業許可</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">飲食店営業、古物商、深夜酒類提供飲食店など、開業に必要な許可を開店日から逆算してご案内します。</p></a></li></ul></div>
<!-- /wp:wdl/paid-block-content-7 -->

<!-- wp:wdl/paid-block-content-7 {"imageBorderRadius":0,"titleBorderRadius":0} -->
<div class="wp-block-wdl-paid-block-content-7 paid-block-content-7"><ul class="paid-block-content-7__inner"><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-hojokin/" class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_list_1/card_7_hojokin.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">補助金・助成金</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">使える制度の洗い出しから事業計画書の作成、採択後の実績報告まで。申請の要件を整理してお手伝いします。</p></a></li><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-jidosha/" class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_list_1/card_8_jidosha.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">自動車登録・車庫証明</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">自動車の名義変更・住所変更や車庫証明の取得を代行します。事業用の増車・減車の届出にも対応しています。</p></a></li><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a href="/gyoseishoshi-contact/" class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:0px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_list_1/card_9_sonota.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">その他のご相談</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">農地転用、内容証明、各種契約書の作成など、この一覧に無い手続きもお気軽にお問い合わせください。</p></a></li></ul></div>
<!-- /wp:wdl/paid-block-content-7 -->

